<title>POLAND: Polish bourse kerb bond deals - October 10.</title>
<headline>Polish bourse kerb bond deals - October 10.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kerb trade through the Warsaw bourse on Thursday saw 600 fixed-interest two-year bonds maturing on October 12, 1998 trading at 94.25 zlotys.</p>
<p>Their turnover was 566,000 zloyts.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
